{
  "react": {
    "observe": "The room is fully unified and stable on NOVA skepticism — nothing has changed cycle over cycle, everyone repeats the same 'no organic volume' line. GoldenWhale confirmed via DM they're also trimming their NOVA test position and will give me lead time if anything changes. Majors (BTC/ETH/SOL) are flat/range-bound. My ETH position is large (2.2 ETH) from prior accumulation, SOL position modest (25.5), BTC small (0.045).",
